{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":182919,"duration_api_ms":183670,"num_turns":20,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9286c758-3a8f-4642-bae4-1af4ab2d33c5","total_cost_usd":0.8878806499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57511,"cache_read_input_tokens":440437,"output_tokens":4015,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57511,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":64,"outputTokens":8040,"cacheReadInputTokens":849144,"cacheCreationInputTokens":66096,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.20779840000000002,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":9,"outputTokens":4015,"cacheReadInputTokens":440437,"cacheCreationInputTokens":57511,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.68008225,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["Full tank_core package test suite: zero failures across all 29+ test binaries (approximately 400+ tests total), zero ignored (except 1 doc-test), zero clippy warnings, formatting check clean.","23 substrate unit tests pass, covering all required acceptance criteria: rooted_plants_increase_o2_penetration, root_oxygenation_proportional_to_biomass_with_diminishing_returns, floating_plant_biomass_does_not_increase_penetration, zero_root_biomass_yields_zero_oxygenation_bonus, root_oxygenation_uses_named_parameter, root_oxygenation_dynamic_tracks_biomass_growth_and_decline, root_oxygenation_requires_rootable_substrate_habitats, zero_rol_rate_removes_rooted_oxygenation_effects.","5 root_zone_oxygenation integration tests pass: planted_vs_unplanted_diverge_in_penetration_depth (500h), planted_substrate_denitrification_interaction (500h), root_oxygenation_reduces_hourly_denitrification_when_it_shrinks_suboxic_volume, planted_substrate_nitrification_surface_area (500h with nitrifier/nitrate divergence), tracing_exposes_root_oxygenation.","12 denitrification tests pass (including test_denitrification_reduces_nitrate_accumulation which previously had a nutrient-store confounder — now fixed with zero stores for both cases).","12 reproduction_factors tests pass including test_mature_stable_tank_breeds_well (previously reported as failing in plan_and_implement stage — now resolved).","16 molt_mineral_budget tests pass including test_zero_ca_and_mg_min_parameters_use_defensive_guards and test_zero_gh_min_parameter_uses_defensive_guard.","ROL formula verified correct (substrate.rs:99-111): bonus = total_depth × (1 - exp(-(active_root_biomass × rol_rate_cm_per_g) / total_depth)). Saturating exponential — linear at low biomass, asymptotic to substrate depth. This satisfies the diminishing-returns acceptance criterion.","Only RootFeedingRosette plants contribute to ROL (substrate.rs:152 guild filter). Floating/epiphytic/fast-stem guilds excluded. Verified by floating_plant_biomass_does_not_increase_penetration unit test.","rol_rate_cm_per_g is a named parameter in ProcessParams (process.rs:176-189) with serde default 0.15 cm/g — not a hardcoded constant.","Tracing/debug output verified: step_substrate_zones emits structured tracing::debug! with base_penetration_cm, root_oxygenation_bonus_cm, active_root_biomass_g, effective_penetration_cm as separate fields (substrate.rs:59-69). Engine records these as four separate BudgetMetricUnit entries. Integration test tracing_exposes_root_oxygenation validates these are present.","Ca/Mg defensive guards applied: update_molt_stress (shrimp.rs:452-453) now uses .max(0.01) for ca_min_mg_per_l and mg_min_mg_per_l, matching the existing GH guard. molt_mineral_modifier (shrimp.rs:1590-1591) similarly applies .max(0.01), plus conditional branches for params ≤ 0.0 returning 1.0.","Snapshot dominant_repro_suppression refactored: snapshot.rs:339 now calls dominant_repro_suppression_label(state) from shrimp.rs:1441, which reuses the shared reproductive_readiness_factors() helper (shrimp.rs:1402-1430). This 7-factor array includes molt_stress plus separate tan/nitrite labels, matching update_reproductive_readiness which uses reproductive_readiness_target (shrimp.rs:1432-1438) — same underlying factor set.","step_substrate_zones returns SubstrateOxygenationBreakdown and engine.rs reuses the returned value for tracing — no redundant recomputation of habitat registry at the engine level."],"findings_or_gaps":["Minor: from_parts (engine.rs:132 area) discards the SubstrateOxygenationBreakdown returned by step_substrate_zones during initialization. Harmless since init-time tracing isn't needed, but a minor API inconsistency. Non-blocking.","Minor: root_oxygenation_active_biomass_g() (substrate.rs:135) internally calls compute_habitat_registry() on each invocation. Since substrate_oxygenation_breakdown also calls this function, there is a redundant registry computation within the substrate module itself. The engine-level double-computation was fixed, but this intra-module redundancy remains. Non-blocking; the computation is cheap.","The prior plan_and_implement stage noted test_mature_stable_tank_breeds_well was failing. It now passes, indicating the reproduction-factor refactoring resolved whatever instability existed. This is a positive signal but the root cause of the prior failure is undocumented."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["No blocking amendments required. All acceptance criteria are met with passing tests, clean clippy, and clean formatting across the full tank_core package."]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"efabd60a-a454-4971-9dfa-dd1b897af573"}
